{"id":"08d7841178f7293b","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse.md","title":"Positive Sigma Relations Are Sigma-1","display":"thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse — Positive Sigma Relations Are Sigma-1","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse","aliases":["92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse"],"display":"thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse — Positive Sigma Relations Are Sigma-1","source":"第 IV 章 pp. 50–53，Propositions C、C1（PDF 67–70）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse — Positive Sigma Relations Are Sigma-1"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章 pp. 50–53，Propositions C、C1（PDF 67–70）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9a375244351119bb\" href=\"?note=9a375244351119bb\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes\">92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_E^{0,k},\\mathcal R_E^{1,k},\\mathcal R_E^{+,k}\">\\(\\mathcal R_E^{0,k},\\mathcal R_E^{1,k},\\mathcal R_E^{+,k}\\)</span> 采用原书规范化文法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(\\vec x,u,z,w)\">\\(D(\\vec x,u,z,w)\\)</span> 为一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0\">\\(\\Sigma_0\\)</span> 关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 为有限自然数界。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}collapse}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R_E^{+,k}&amp;=\\mathcal R_E^{1,k},\\qquad\\mathcal R_E^{0,k}\\subseteq\\mathcal R_E^{1,k},\\\\\n\\forall u\\leq z\\;\\exists w\\;D(\\vec x,u,z,w)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists v\\;\\forall u\\leq z\\;\\exists w\\leq v\\;D(\\vec x,u,z,w).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}collapse}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R_E^{+,k}&amp;=\\mathcal R_E^{1,k},\\qquad\\mathcal R_E^{0,k}\\subseteq\\mathcal R_E^{1,k},\\\\\n\\forall u\\leq z\\;\\exists w\\;D(\\vec x,u,z,w)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists v\\;\\forall u\\leq z\\;\\exists w\\leq v\\;D(\\vec x,u,z,w).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键是有限界下的统一见证：为 u=0,…,z 选出各自有限见证后，取其最大值 v；反向直接去掉 w≤v。无需统一决定一个无穷见证族。</p>\n<p>多个无界存在量词合成一个时，取包含所有见证的共同上界，再把各见证改为 bounded。合取使用共同上界；析取选择满足的一边；bounded 存在直接加入矩阵；bounded 全称用显示等价；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0\">\\(\\Sigma_0\\)</span> 前件的蕴涵写成其有界否定与后件的析取。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_E^+\">\\(\\mathcal S_E^+\\)</span> 的形成归纳便得到包含关系，反向由其闭包条款直接成立。</p>\n<p>这是标准自然数上的关系类结论，不宣称每一项都在任意弱系统中统一可证，也不对任意否定保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes","status":"resolved","id":"9a375244351119bb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal R_E^{0,k},\\mathcal R_E^{1,k},\\mathcal R_E^{+,k}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"D(\\vec x,u,z,w)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_0","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}collapse}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R_E^{+,k}&=\\mathcal R_E^{1,k},\\qquad\\mathcal R_E^{0,k}\\subseteq\\mathcal R_E^{1,k},\\\\\n\\forall u\\leq z\\;\\exists w\\;D(\\vec x,u,z,w)\n&\\leftrightarrow\\exists v\\;\\forall u\\leq z\\;\\exists w\\leq v\\;D(\\vec x,u,z,w).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S_E^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false}],"bytes":1751,"backlinks":[{"id":"e095d63f890051fd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7ce1b12990ae9469","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书这里先给一个无界存在量词的 Σ₁ 文法，并给正 Σ 类与关系类合并定理。本文通过逻辑等价闭包定义所有有限层级，属于扩展；不能把任意否定封闭当作原书正 Σ 的规则。见 [[92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse]]。"},{"id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本文把空集另列，避免用不存在的总函数值域表示空集。原书正 Σ/Σ₁ 表达路线见 [[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse]]；Σ₁ 与 c.e. 的标准正常形等价是递归论背景，不能把标准模型表达直接当作系统内逐例正负可证明性。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-beta-function]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-beta-coding]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse]] → [[92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-elimination]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-pa-semantic-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"fffc9733e4a34483","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"右向由函数唯一性；左向用总性取 z=f(x)。在表达 graph 的 Σ₁ 公式中先改名，使新的 z 与其它变量、见证变量不相冲突；与数码/变量不等的 Σ₀ 条件合取，再加存在量词，得到正 Σ 公式。[[92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse]] 将它化为 Σ₁，故 graph 的补关系也 Σ₁。"},{"id":"c056f7fa0375bc62","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-317","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse]]"}],"outgoing":["9a375244351119bb"]}